{"id":"n71221-2-7","stage":2,"title":"저녁때 · 晚饭时间","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71221-2-7-1","ko":"지수야, 엄마 시장 다녀올게.","zh":"智秀啊，妈妈要去市场一趟哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수야,","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"엄마","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"2","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시장","meaning":"市场","explanation":"시장：市场","readings":[{"term":"시장","audio":"/audio/b46fa208d9de21d2daf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17193","senseId":"1","lemma":"시장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다녀올게.","meaning":"去一趟，去一下","explanation":"다녀오다：去一趟，去一下；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"다녀오다","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64529","senseId":"2","lemma":"다녀오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"主要加在子女名字后面，在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的女性。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"b46fa208d9de21d2","term":"시장","zh":"市场","audio":"/audio/b46fa208d9de21d2daf1.mp3","entryId":"17193","definition":"买卖各种商品的地方。","pronunciation":["시ː장"]},{"id":"09b8a3cf21a41c7a","term":"다녀오다","zh":"去一趟，去一下","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3","entryId":"64529","definition":"为做某事而去某地后又回来。","pronunciation":["다녀오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ff7aa2637a312d7ea0f1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71221-2-7-2","ko":"저녁때가 되기 전에는 오셔야 돼요.","zh":"必须在晚饭时间之前回来才行。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저녁때가","meaning":"晚饭时间","explanation":"저녁때：晚饭时间；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"저녁때","audio":"/audio/d9bbfbf8a2b87205b2e8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71221","senseId":"2","lemma":"저녁때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되기","meaning":"到","explanation":"되다：到；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전에는","meaning":"上","explanation":"전：上；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17306","senseId":"2","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오셔야","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼요.","meaning":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","explanation":"되다：应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"18","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d9bbfbf8a2b87205","term":"저녁때","zh":"晚饭时间","audio":"/audio/d9bbfbf8a2b87205b2e8.mp3","entryId":"71221","definition":"吃晚饭的时候。","pronunciation":["저녁때"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"到；应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"到达某个时间、时期或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"d9f427c3257e81e0","term":"전","zh":"上","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3","entryId":"17306","definition":"时间上之前的。","pronunciation":["전"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"到达想去的地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d0a75c95f4c87076cd60.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.977,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71221","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sou